[
  {
    "content_id": "10008001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;在士師執政的時代，猶大發生了饑荒。有一個人帶著妻子和兩個兒子從猶大的伯利恆遷到摩押境內寄居。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;這個人名叫以利米勒，妻子叫拿俄米，兩個兒子分別叫瑪倫和基連。他們都是猶大 伯利恆的以法他人。他們來到摩押，就在那裡住了下來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;後來，拿俄米的丈夫以利米勒去世了，留下她和兩個兒子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;這兩個兒子都娶了摩押的女子為妻，一個名叫俄珥巴，一個名叫路得。在那裡住了大約十年後，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;瑪倫和基連二人都去世了，只剩下拿俄米，沒有了丈夫，也沒有了兒子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;後來，拿俄米在摩押聽說耶和華眷顧祂的子民，使他們五穀豐登，就帶著兩個兒媳婦準備回故鄉。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;她們離開所居住的地方，動身返回猶大。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米對兩個兒媳婦說：「你們還是各回娘家去吧！願耶和華恩待你們，就好像你們恩待死去的丈夫和我一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;願耶和華使你們都有機會再嫁，找到好歸宿。」拿俄米說完了，就親吻她們。她們都放聲大哭，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;說：「不！我們要跟你一起回你的家鄉。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米說：「我的女兒啊，回娘家去吧！為什麼要跟我去呢？難道我還能生兒子做你們的丈夫嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;回去吧！我的女兒啊，走吧！我已經老了，不可能再嫁人了。就算我還有指望，今晚能再結婚生子，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;難道你們能一直不嫁，等到他們長大嗎？不要這樣，我的女兒啊！這樣你們會很苦，我就更苦了，因為耶和華伸手懲罰我。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;她們又放聲大哭，俄珥巴就親吻婆婆，向她道別，但路得卻依依不捨，不肯離去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米說：「你看，你嫂嫂已經回她家鄉和她拜的神明那裡去了，你也跟著嫂嫂回去吧！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;路得說：「不要逼我撇你而去。你往哪裡去，我也要往哪裡去；你住在哪裡，我也要住在哪裡；你的同胞就是我的同胞，你的上帝就是我的上帝；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你死在哪裡，我也死在哪裡、葬在哪裡。只有死才能把我們分開。否則，願耶和華重重地懲罰我！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米見路得堅決要跟她走，就不再勸阻她了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;於是，二人便一同回到伯利恆。她們進了伯利恆，全城轟動。婦女們問：「這不是拿俄米嗎？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米對她們說：「不要再叫我拿俄米了，叫我瑪拉吧！因為全能者叫我過得好苦啊！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我曾滿滿地離開這裡，現在耶和華卻使我空空地回來。既然耶和華叫我受苦，全能者使我遭難，為何還叫我拿俄米呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米帶著她的兒媳婦摩押女子路得從摩押回到了伯利恆，那時正是開始收割大麥的季節。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米的丈夫以利米勒有個親戚，名叫波阿斯，是個有名望的財主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;摩押女子路得對拿俄米說：「讓我到田裡去，跟在那些願意恩待我的人後面，撿些麥穗回來。」拿俄米說：「去吧，我的女兒！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;於是，路得便去了。她恰巧來到以利米勒的親戚波阿斯的田裡，跟在收割的人後面撿麥穗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;當時，波阿斯剛好從伯利恆來到田間，向那些收割的工人問安說：「願耶和華與你們同在。」他們回答說：「願耶和華賜福給你。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯問負責收割的工頭說：「那是誰家的女子？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;工頭回答說：「她是摩押女子，跟拿俄米剛從摩押回來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;她求我讓她跟在收割的人後面，撿工人紮捆時遺落的麥穗。她一大早就來到這裡，一直撿到現在，除了在涼棚裡稍微坐了一會兒之外，幾乎沒有休息。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯對路得說：「姑娘，聽我說，你不用到別人的田裡去拾麥穗了，也不必離開這裡，只管留下來跟我的女工在一起。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你看我的工人在哪一塊田裡收割，就跟著我的女工去，我已經吩咐工人不可欺負你。要是你渴了，就去水罐那裡喝工人打回來的水。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;路得就俯伏在地叩謝他，說：「我不過是個外族人，你為什麼這樣恩待我、體恤我？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯說：「自從你丈夫過世之後，你怎樣善待婆婆，怎樣離開父母和家鄉來到素不相識的人當中，我都聽說了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;願耶和華照你所行的獎賞你！你來投靠在以色列的上帝耶和華的翅膀下，願祂厚厚地賞賜你。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;路得說：「我主啊！我真是在你面前蒙恩，雖然我連你的婢女都不如，你還好言安慰我。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;吃飯的時候，波阿斯對路得說：「來，吃一點餅吧，可以蘸著醋吃。」路得便坐在那些收割工人旁邊。波阿斯遞給她一些烤好的麥穗。她吃飽了，還有剩餘的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;當她起來又要去撿麥穗的時候，波阿斯就吩咐他的工人說：「你們要任由她撿，就算她從麥捆中撿麥穗，你們也不要為難她。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;甚至要從麥捆中抽一些出來讓她撿，不要責罵她。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;於是，路得便在田間繼續撿麥穗，到了黃昏，她把撿到的麥穗打了，大約有十公斤大麥。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;她把撿來的麥子帶回城裡給婆婆拿俄米看，又把剩下來的食物給婆婆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;婆婆問她：「你今天在哪裡拾麥穗？在哪裡做工？願那善待你的人蒙福！」她就告訴婆婆說：「今天我在一個名叫波阿斯的人那裡工作。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米說：「願耶和華賜福給他，他對活著的和過世的都是那麼有情有義。」拿俄米又對路得說：「這人是我們的近親，有為我們贖業的責任。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;摩押女子路得說：「他還對我說，『你可以跟在我的工人後面撿麥穗，直到他們把我的莊稼都收完為止。』」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米對兒媳路得說：「我的女兒啊，你就跟他的女工一起到田裡去，免得去別人的田裡被欺負。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;因此，路得便常跟波阿斯的女工在一起撿麥穗，直到大麥小麥都收割完畢。路得就這樣陪伴婆婆過日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;一天，路得的婆婆拿俄米對她說：「我的女兒啊，我實在應該為你找個好歸宿，使你生活幸福。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯不是我們的親戚嗎？而且你又常與他的女工在一起。今晚他會在麥場簸大麥。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你要梳洗打扮、抹上香膏、換件衣服，然後去麥場，但不要讓他認出你是誰。等他吃飽喝足，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;躺下睡覺的時候，你看準他躺臥的地方，去掀開蓋在他腳上的被，躺在那裡，到時他必定會告訴你該怎樣做。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;路得說：「好，我一定照你的吩咐去做。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;於是，路得就到麥場去，照她婆婆吩咐的去做。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯吃過晚飯，心裡舒暢，便躺在麥堆旁邊睡著了。路得悄悄過去掀起蓋在他腳上的被，躺在他腳旁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;到了半夜，波阿斯忽然驚醒，翻過身來，發現一個女子躺在他的腳旁，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;便問道：「你是誰？」她答道：「我是你的婢女路得，請用你的衣襟遮蓋我，因為你是我的近親。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯說：「姑娘，願耶和華賜福給你，因為你一直對婆家情深義重，現在更是如此。你本來可以找一個富有或貧窮的年輕丈夫，然而你卻沒有這樣做。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;姑娘，不要害怕，你所說的一切，我都會去為你安排，城裡所有的人都知道你是個賢德的女子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;不錯，我是你的近親，可是有一個人比我更近。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你今晚就留在這裡，明天早上，如果他答應盡親屬的義務，就由他照顧你；如果他不肯，我憑永活的耶和華起誓，我會盡我的本分。現在你只管安心睡到天亮。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;路得就躺在波阿斯的腳旁。天未亮，還看不清人的時候，路得就起來了。因為波阿斯曾對她說：「不可讓別人知道有女人來過麥場。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;離開的時候，波阿斯對她說：「把你的外衣拿來鋪開。」路得就照做了。他用路得的外衣包了六簸箕大麥，幫她扛在肩上，她便回城了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;回到家中，婆婆問她：「女兒啊，怎麼樣了？」路得便將事情的經過都告訴了婆婆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;她又說：「那個人給了我六簸箕大麥，對我說，『不要空手回去見你婆婆。』」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米說：「女兒啊！你只管安靜等候，看這事怎樣發展，因為那人今天不把事情辦妥，是絕不會休息的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯來到城門口，坐在那裡，恰巧看見他所說的那位至親經過，便招呼他說：「某人啊，請過來坐一坐。」那人便走過來坐下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯又邀請了城裡的十位長老，對他們說：「請過來坐一坐。」他們都坐下以後，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯便對那位至親說：「拿俄米從摩押回來了，現在要賣我們族兄以利米勒的那塊地，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我想應該讓你知道這件事。你最有權贖那塊地，其次才是我，此外再沒有別人了。如果你願意贖回那塊地，請你當著在座各位長老的面表明。如果不願意，請你讓我知道。」那人說：「我願意贖。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯說：「那麼，你從拿俄米手中買地的那天，也要娶已死之人的妻子摩押女子路得，好讓死者繼續在產業上留名。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;那位至親說：「那我就不能贖了，免得損害到我的產業。你來贖吧，我不能贖。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;從前在以色列，買贖或交易有這樣的規矩：一旦成交，一方要把鞋脫下來交給另一方，以色列人以此為成交的憑據。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;那位至親對波阿斯說：「你自己買吧！」他就把鞋脫了下來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯向長老和所有在場的人說：「請各位今天為我作證，所有屬於以利米勒、基連和瑪倫的產業，我都從拿俄米手上買了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;同時，我要娶瑪倫的遺孀摩押女子路得為妻，好使死者繼續在產業上留名，免得他的名在本族本鄉中消失。今天，請各位作證。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;聚集在城門口的眾人和長老都說：「我們願意作證。願耶和華使要進你家門的這女子，像建立以色列家的拉結和利亞一樣。願你在以法他家業興隆，在伯利恆聲名遠揚。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;願耶和華藉著這年輕女子賜你後裔，使你家像先祖猶大和她瑪的兒子法勒斯家一樣。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;這樣，波阿斯便娶了路得為妻，與她同房。耶和華使她懷孕生了一個兒子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;婦女們對拿俄米說：「耶和華當受稱頌！因為今日祂賜給你一位至親，使你後繼有人，願這孩子在以色列得享盛名！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他必讓你的生命重新得力，奉養你，使你安度晚年，因為他是愛你的兒媳婦所生的。有這兒媳婦比有七個兒子還要好！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米接過嬰孩抱在懷中，照顧他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;鄰居的婦女們說：「拿俄米有孩子了！」她們給孩子取名叫俄備得，這俄備得就是耶西的父親，耶西是大衛的父親。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;以下是法勒斯的家譜：法勒斯生希斯崙，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;希斯崙生蘭，蘭生亞米拿達，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;亞米拿達生拿順，拿順生撒門，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;撒門生波阿斯，波阿斯生俄備得，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得記 4:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;俄備得生耶西，耶西生大衛。</p>"
  }
]